# 1. All Signs Allign


## Solution:

- The challenge used the concept of quadratic residue to make an encryption.
- The core challenge used a function get_x to obtain the value of x as a quadratic residue 

```
def get_x():
    while True:
        x = randint(2,p-1)
        if pow(x,(p-1)//2,p) == 1:
            break
    return x
```


